# .Renviron - Environment variables for GBIF Sweden Gap Analysis
# ==============================================================================
# This file stores sensitive credentials that should NOT be committed to git.
# 
# IMPORTANT: Add this file to .gitignore!
#
# Usage:
#   1. Replace the placeholder values below with your actual GBIF credentials
#   2. Restart R (or run readRenviron(".Renviron")) for changes to take effect
#   3. Access in R with: Sys.getenv("GBIF_USER")
#
# Create a GBIF account at: https://www.gbif.org/user/profile

# GBIF API credentials
GBIF_USER=your_username_here
GBIF_EMAIL=your_email_here
GBIF_PWD=your_password_here

# Artdatabanken (Dyntaxa) API subscription key. OPTIONAL.
# 01a normally resolves the archive URL from the GBIF registry and never reads
# this. It is only needed as a fallback if that lookup fails. The key is public
# (GBIF publishes it as the dataset's registered DWC_ARCHIVE endpoint) — it is
# kept out of the repo for tidiness, not because it is sensitive. Read the
# current value from api.gbif.org/v1/dataset/de8934f4-a136-481c-a87a-b0b202b80a31/endpoint
DYNTAXA_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY=your_subscription_key_here
